{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "This is starting to sound ridiculous... but I guess I'll give it a shot.": "",
  "Oh yeah, you two probably have no idea where to start, so let me give you some pointers.": "",
  "Ooh, yes please!": "",
  "So, girls who are on their way somewhere are generally cold prospects. Instead, find a girl who's just standing around.": "",
  "Also, you'll need to rely on your observational skills.": "",
  "Oh... you mean I should constantly be checking them out?": "",
  "Sort of. Since this is a competition here, talking to every girl you see might not be the best tactic.": "",
  "Instead, try figuring out what kind of girl would actually stop and listen to you. That will make or break your game.": "",
  "I see. So I really need to be observant here.": "",
  "Well, ready to get started?": "",
  "Ready... set... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>go</font_kind>!": "",
  "(Should I just go with this girl?)": "",
  "Excuse me, can I talk to you for a second?": "",
  "(All right, I got this far. Now what should I say?)": "",
  "Oh, nothing. I just thought you were really cute.": "",
  "Yeah, so I'm waiting for my boyfriend right now. You wanna say that to him, too?": "",
  "Oh! No, not really... Sorry about that.": "",
  "Would you mind taking a picture with me?": "",
  "And <font_kind=yakuza_italic>why</font_kind> would I wanna do that?": "",
  "Because I'm trying to win a flirting contest and I need a girl wearing red. That's really all there is to it.": "",
  "...You want me to call the police?": "",
  "Or maybe I should just call my boyfriend. Would you like that better?": "",
  "All right, I get the idea. Sorry to bother you.": "",
  "Are you going anywhere right now?": "",
  "Why would you ask that...? You don't even know me!": "",
  "Oh, no, I was just thinking... Maybe you were lost, and... I could give you some directions?": "",
  "How about <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> get lost? I'm waiting for my boyfriend right now.": "",
  "Ah. I didn't realize. Sorry to bug you, then.": "",
  "(...That was awful. Maybe I should pay more attention to who I want to ask next time.)": "",
  "Uh... Can I help you?": "",
  "A cute girl like you? You definitely can help.": "",
  "You... You really think I'm cute?": "",
  "I do. Sorry if that came out of nowhere... but it's true.": "",
  "You're not... trying to get me to do something weird, are you?": "",
  "Oh, no, of course not. Actually...": "",
  "Would you consider yourself photogenic?": "",
  "You see, me and this... acquaintance of mine, we're going around taking pictures of girls... Wait, that sounded bad.": "",
  "Yeah. It did.": "",
  "(Dang, I think I screwed up. Let's see if I can save this...)": "",
  "Actually, I was just wondering if you were lost.": "",
  "Oh... As a matter of fact, I am.": "",
  "Gotcha. I didn't mean to startle you or anything.": "",
  "But I noticed that you seemed a little worried, so I thought maybe I could help.": "",
  "Huh, that's nice of you...": "",
  "So, where exactly are you trying to find?": "",
  "Oh, umm... I'm looking for a place called Bar Tender.": "",
  "Hey, that's my go-to spot.": "",
  "Want me to give you directions there?": "",
  "Thanks, but I'm actually terrible with directions... I'm sure I'll make it somehow.": "",
  "(If I escort her there... Maybe it would give me an excuse to ask for her picture!)": "",
  "Actually, Tender's not even that far away, so I wouldn't mind guiding you there.": "",
  "Totally. I know the owner pretty well, so I'd be a terrible friend if I didn't help one of his customers find her way.": "",
  "...You're not some kinda stalker, are you?": "",
  "Here, why don't I introduce myself? My name's Takayuki Yagami, and I only stalk the bad guys. I'm a detective, see.": "",
  "Oh, you are? Thank goodness.": "",
  "Then lead the way, detective.": "",
  "I'll get you there safe and sound.": "",
  "All right, here's Tender.": "",
  "Thank you so much. You really were a nice guy after all.": "",
  "Now, I hate to ask this, but... I was actually wondering if you could do me a small favor.": "",
  "Oh, like what?": "",
  "Would you mind taking a quick photo with me?": "",
  "Huh? A photo? Together?": "",
  "Yeah. See, I got suckered into a contest to find someone who would take a cute picture with me. Pretty stupid, right?": "",
  "Wow, and you're actually going through with it? Haha, that is pretty stupid! But hey, at least you're honest.": "",
  "That's my policy.": "",
  "If that's the case, sure, I'll take a picture with you. Just don't upload it anywhere, okay?": "",
  "Wow, this turned out good.": "",
  "Now I'd love to talk more, but unfortunately I gotta get back first, so... See ya!": "",
  "Damn! Time's up already?": "",
  "How did I not make it...?": "",
  "Hey, this is actually a nice picture. Didn't think you'd pull it off.": "",
  "Why? Why wouldn't anyone want a picture with the future Emperor of the Night?": "",
  "So you came back empty-handed.": "",
  "Of course I did. This whole thing's impossible! No matter how much I talked or what I said, they didn't wanna hear it.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Well I got a picture just fine.": "",
  "Yup. He totally destroyed you, man.": "",
  "Damn... I had no idea you were such a player, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yeah, and he's not even a host. If your game's not even on his level, you might as well pack your shit.": "",
  "No... I can't just give up here! Not when I've come so far! Please, just one more chance!": "",
  "...You wanna become a host that bad, huh?": "",
  "Well, Yagami-san? You'll be the one facing him.": "",
  "Rematch? Yes? For old times' sake?": "",
  "And if I beat you again, you'll give up this nonsense for good?": "",
  "Absolutely. A man is only as good as his word!": "",
  "All right. I'll play along then.": "",
  "Come talk to us when you're ready to get started.": "",
  "So. Shall we?": "",
  "Fine, let's do this.": "",
  "Remember, if you lose to me, you're going on a one-way trip to tuna land.": "",
  "Yeah. I know.": "",
  "Okay then. Seiya, the criteria?": "",
  "Well, how about...": "",
  "Yagami-san, your job is to find a girl who's still attending school. University, junior college, doesn't really matter.": "",
  "Won't it be kind of hard to find a student around here though?": "",
  "True. Then consider it a handicap since you won last time.": "",
  "Psh, more like handi<font_kind=yakuza_italic>crap</font_kind>...": "",
  "You guys ready? First one back wins. Now... get out there!": "",
  "Sure! Were you gonna ask me out somewhere?": "",
  "(Oh? She seems pretty open-minded.)": "",
  "Let's go hang out!": "",
  "Actually, can we take a picture together instead?": "",
  "Huh? A photo? Okay, but that'll cost extra.": "",
  "Cost extra? What do you mean?": "",
  "You actually thought I was a schoolgirl? Even though I'm standing in the ritziest red-light district in Tokyo?": "",
  "Ah... You're working for an image club, aren't you?": "",
  "Yup. If I look like a real high schooler, then that means I've still got it! Hehe.": "",
  "(Damn. What a waste of time.)": "",
  "Whoa, a kid. What's the matter, little guy?": "",
  "I can't find my big sister...": "",
  "That's not good. Do you know where the police station is?": "",
  "Well, Mom always told me you're not supposed to move when you're lost.": "",
  "Right, that's smart.": "",
  "Yup. So I'm doing a good job.": "",
  "(He seems pretty mature for his age...)": "",
  "Ren-chan, where did you run off to?": "",
  "What? What do you want?": "",
  "Could I take a photo with you?": "",
  "...Being that you're so cute and all.": "",
  "Why would you even say that!? I don't have time for that right now!": "",
  "Please, don't bother me anymore!": "",
  "...Sorry about that.": "",
  "You seem a bit panicked. Is there something wrong?": "",
  "Well, yes. You see, I was with my little brother... and now he's nowhere to be found.": "",
  "A lost child...": "",
  "He's about eight years old.": "",
  "You know. I think I've seen that kid.": "",
  "What! Really? Where!?": "",
  "Should I just take you to him?": "",
  "Yes!! Please!!": "",
  "Ren-chan!": "",
  "Oh, Sis! You came!": "",
  "I'm so glad I found you. You disappeared all of a sudden... I was so worried.": "",
  "Thank you, sir. You really helped a lot.": "",
  "Is there any way I can thank you?": "",
  "Well... Would you mind taking a picture with me?": "",
  "A picture? Sure... but why?": "",
  "The hell you think you're doing!?": "",
  "(Deguchi-san? Just what is he getting into this time?)": "",
  "Sorry! I didn't know you guys were together!": "",
  "Yeah right! You were trying to use my girl as a wallet... I know how you host sickos think!": "",
  "No, that wasn't my intention at all!": "",
  "Bull<font_kind=yakuza_italic>shit</font_kind>! Get ready to enter a world of hurt, motherfucker! ": "",
  "(Hmm... If I help him now, I'll almost certainly lose the contest. But if I don't... then Deguchi will lose several teeth.)": "",
  "(Well, this is my one chance. Sorry, buddy.)": "",
  "Really, I said I'm sorry...": "",
  "Aww, the poor widdle host said he's sawwy... Well you can shove that apology straight up your ass, 'cause it don't mean shit!": "",
  "(I really shouldn't be ignoring this...)": "",
  "Hey, you there.": "",
  "You want something, man?": "",
  "Yeah, that guy's my friend. Sorry if he caused you any trouble.": "",
  "You think I give a shit if you're <font_kind=yakuza_italic>sorry</font_kind>?": "",
  "Then what do you suggest?": "",
  "Let me get a few hits on this bastard. And I won't take \"no\" for an answer.": "",
  "Then try hitting me instead. Bet you won't land a single one.": "",
  "Fine by me. Hope you've written out a last will and testament!": "",
  "Yeah, somehow... I ended up talking to the wrong girl...": "",
  "But, Yagami-san... that girl you were talking to earlier got scared and took off.": "",
  "Oh crap...": "",
  "Agh, it's all my fault. I got us both disqualified, I put you in danger...": "",
  "Hey, it's fine. You're my client's nephew, after all. I couldn't just let you get hurt.": "",
  "Yagami-san... You're one badass dude.": "",
  "Let's just get back to Seiya.": "",
  "So neither of you got a picture, huh? Then I guess that makes this a draw.": "",
  "Actually, Seiya-san... Our contest does have a winner.": "",
  "It's Yagami-san. He saved me from getting beaten up.": "",
  "If he hadn't stopped what he was doing and helped me, I'm sure he would've won.": "",
  "Yagami-san, is this true?": "",
  "Well, yeah, I was pretty close...": "",
  "Then you admit your loss, Deguchi? Think carefully—your dream of being a host is on the line here.": "",
  "It's cool. I don't want to cause you any more trouble than I already have... I owe you, man!": "",
  "You sure about this?": "",
  "Yeah. I'll go work on the tuna boat like I promised. I'm a failure as a host anyway.": "",
  "Wait. No one here thinks you're a failure, Deguchi.": "",
  "At first, I thought you were just another wannabe who talked big and couldn't back it up. But now I know you really can.": "",
  "You... You mean that?": "",
  "Yeah. And I've been watching you work your magic out there, too. You ended up talking to way more girls than I expected.": "",
  "Well, I know I'm not the best-looking guy, so I figured I'd just talk my ass off until some magic actually happened.": "",
  "And you kept at it, too. Despite how many times you got rejected.": "",
  "Of course. Even though many of them said horribly crippling things that will scar me for years to come...": "",
  "...None of that really matters as long as my dream is alive! Besides, I'm sure there's at least one girl out there who can appreciate my style.": "",
  "Not sure where your confidence comes from, but I like that you stick to your guns. You're super enthusiastic, too.": "",
  "...Yeah, I can see it working. I think that, with a little bit of polish, you could end up being a pretty decent host.": "",
  "Then, does that mean...?": "",
  "Yeah. I wouldn't mind talking to the owner for you. What do you think, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I think you should get on a tuna boat.": "",
  "What!? Are you telling me to give up on my dream when it's right in front of me!? That'd be sending me to my death!": "",
  "Well, I certainly don't want that...": "",
  "I guess as long as you pay your debt to Taniyama-san, it's fine.": "",
  "Remember, your level of success in this industry is all on you.": "",
  "And there are times being a host is much more difficult than being on a tuna boat.": "",
  "Then I'll just have to give it 110%! No, 120%!": "",
  "All right. I'll be holding you to that.": "",
  "Well, Yagami-san... Guess this is it. I dunno what I would've done without you!": "",
  "Make sure you explain your situation to your aunt and get her approval, okay?": "",
  "You bet I will!": "",
  "I'll just work my Deguchi magic, and... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>shabooya</font_kind>! She'll see it my way for sure.": "",
  "Haha, okay, but do you really think it's that simple?": "",
  "Well, if I can persuade a strict old lady like my aunt, then talking to girls on the street should be a cinch! In theory.": "",
  "Maybe so. Then I hope it all works out for you.": "",
  "(The first one back wins. So I'd better not go too far.)": "",
  "All right, your order will be ready shortly!": "",
  "So, how's the food treating you?": "",
  "Oh, it was delicious.": "",
  "Awesome. I'm really glad to hear that!": "",
  "Just so you know, we use a special method called fresh-aging to prepare our steaks without them ever seeing a freezer.": "",
  "No wonder they're so soft and succulent.": "",
  "Not only that, but our beef undergoes a rigorous selection process to ensure that only the best reaches your table!": "",
  "Even though the prices are so cheap?": "",
  "Absolutely! We do our utmost best to serve our customers the highest quality meat for the lowest possible price!": "",
  "Wow, that's pretty neat.": "",
  "*huff* P-President Ichinose! *huff* So this is where you've been...": "",
  "It's almost time for your meeting, so please come back to the office!": "",
  "Oh, Motomura-kun. It's that time already?": "",
  "...Wait, you're the guy who runs this place!?": "",
  "Ah, yes. I apologize for not mentioning it sooner.": "",
  "I'm Kunio Ichinose, and yes, I do run Ikinari Steak.": "",
  "Wow, the president of the whole franchise... What are you doing here, then?": "",
  "\"Let customers be the judge!\" is what I've always lived by, so I came to get a feel for how this place is running.": "",
  "Gotcha. I knew you weren't just another employee.": "",
  "Pardon me, but... we really should get going, sir.": "",
  "Ah, that's right. Sorry, sorry.": "",
  "By the way, what's your name?": "",
  "Yagami-san, I appreciate you dining with us today.": "",
  "Please come back and enjoy our steaks again!": "",
  "Definitely.": "",
  "(To think I met the president of the franchise...)": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san, it's good to see you again!": "",
  "Good to see you too, President Ichinose. Are you here to supervise again?": "",
  "That's right. After all, my management philosophy has always been...": "",
  "...\"Let customers be the judge,\" wasn't it?": "",
  "Bingo! You got it word for word!": "",
  "Let me ask you something. When you think of a successful manager, what qualities come to mind?": "",
  "A successful manager, huh? Hmm, let me think here...": "",
  "I'd have to say a manager who makes the most profit. That is the bottom line in business, after all.": "",
  "I'd have to say a manager with authority. You don't just get that kind of position without the character to back it up.": "",
  "I'd have to say a manager with a lot of people under him. It makes you feel like you've climbed the corporate ladder.": "",
  "I'd have to say a manager who can create something both innovative and useful. Not everyone has that kind of mind.": "",
  "Well, when I think of what a successful manager should be...": "",
  "I think of someone who puts the customer first.": "",
  "For example, we've created a restaurant that doesn't make the customer choose between quality or affordability.": "",
  "Instead, we give the customer both, and that way the customers win both ways!": "",
  "You're right. That is a good deal.": "",
  "And if our customers feel like they're being put first, then they'll keep coming back.": "",
  "What that means is if our customers win, then as far as I'm concerned, so do we.  ": "",
  "That's been my philosophy since our restaurant first began.": "",
  "And that's a great philosophy to have. No wonder they made you president.": "",
  "Hahaha, what can I say?": "",
  "*pant* P-President Ichinose! You're here again?": "",
  "It's almost time for your meeting, remember? We need to get back to the office right away!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Fine, let's do this.": "ได้ งั้นมาสู้กัน",
  "Hey, you there.": "เฮ้ พี่ครับ",
  "Oh crap...": "โอ๊ยแย่แล้ว...",
  "Definitely.": "แน่นอน"
 }
}
